rabhu"},"title":["After parikramā"],"author":["by Śrīla Rūpa Goswāmī Prabhu"],"verses":[{"text":["nagara bhramiyā āmāra gaura ela ghare","gaura ela ghare āmāra nitāi ela ghare","dhūlā jhāri’ śachīmātā gaura kole kare","ānandete bhakta-gaṇe hari hari bale"],"translation":["After touring the town, my Gaurāṅga came home! My Gaurāṅga and my Nitāi came home! After dusting Him off, Śachī Mātā embraces Gaurāṅga! The devotees joyfully sing “Hari! Hari!”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"1","text":["rādhe jaya jaya mādhava-dayite","gokula-taruṇī-maṇḍala-mahite"],"translation":["O Rādhā! O Beloved of Mādhava! O heroine of the girls of Gokula! All glory to You! All glory to You!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["dāmodara-rati-vardhana-veśe","hari-niṣkuṭa-vṛndā-vipineśe"],"translation":["O She who dresses to increase Dāmodar’s attachment! O Queen of Hari’s pleasure groves in Vṛndāvan!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vṛṣabhānūdadhi-nava-śaśi-lekhe","lalitā-sakhi guṇa-ramita-viśākhe"],"translation":["O new moon who has arisen from the ocean of King Vṛṣabhānu! O friend of Lalitā! O charmer of Viśākhā!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["karuṇāṁ kuru mayi karuṇā-bharite","sanaka-sanātana-varṇita-charite"],"translation":["Be merciful to me, O You who are filled with mercy! O She whose glory is sung by Sanaka and Sanātan!"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-radhe-jaya","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/acharyamaharaj/sri-radhika-stava","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.P. Janardan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/janardan-m